        <li><p><url href="https://math.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Linear_Algebra/Linear_Algebra_with_Applications_(Nicholson)/02%3A_Matrix_Algebra/2.04%3A_Matrix_Inverses/2.4E%3A_Matrix_Inverses_Exercises">Nicholson 2.4.5(h)</url></p></li>
